          "answer": "Walking to the station",
          "explanation": "Devam eden sahne."
        },
        {
          "id": "r2",
          "prompt": "What short event happened in the square?",
          "options": [
            "A cyclist dropped a bag.",
            "They were waiting.",
            "It was raining."
          ],
          "answer": "A cyclist dropped a bag.",
          "explanation": "Bitmiş kısa olay."
        }
      ],
      "extra": {
        "title": "A Busy Restaurant Evening",
        "instructions": "Uzun metni oku ve ayrıntıları seç.",
        "paragraphs": [
          "Mina worked in a small restaurant last Saturday. At six o’clock, the dining room was quiet, and the kitchen team was preparing dinner. Mina was putting glasses on the tables when the first family arrived. Soon, every table was full. One chef cooked the main dishes while another chef was making desserts.",
          "At eight o’clock, the lights suddenly went out. It was very dark, but nobody panicked. The customers turned on their phone lights while the manager checked the electricity. Mina brought candles from a cupboard. Ten minutes later, the lights came back. The customers clapped because the team handled the problem calmly. At the end of the evening, the manager thanked everyone. Mina was tired, but she felt proud."
        ],
        "questions": [
          {
            "id": "er1",
            "prompt": "What was Mina doing when the first family arrived?",
            "options": [
              "Putting glasses on tables",
              "Checking electricity",
              "Making desserts"
            ],
            "answer": "Putting glasses on tables",
            "explanation": "was putting + arrived."
          },
          {
            "id": "er2",
            "prompt": "What happened at eight?",
            "options": [
              "The lights went out.",
              "The restaurant opened.",
              "Mina went home."
            ],
            "answer": "The lights went out.",
            "explanation": "Kısa bitmiş olay."
          },
          {
            "id": "er3",
            "prompt": "Which activity continued during the problem?",
            "options": [
              "Customers were using phone lights.",
              "The manager thanked everyone.",
              "The first family arrived."
            ],
            "answer": "Customers were using phone lights.",
            "explanation": "Past continuous."
          }
        ]
      }
